<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd" identifier="pcb-item-40c17a16208846c892ba1aaff10d57af" title="sat-c1-u22-sublime.html qc1" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>B</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float"><qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value></qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        <p>Which sentence uses &quot;sublime&quot; correctly?</p>
    <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">The new airport parking garage is sublime, with spaces wide enough to open both doors fully and elevators that have never once broken down.</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="B">From the research station&apos;s deck, the aurora unfurled in silent green curtains, a sublime display that left the crew speechless.</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="C">The hikers found the drizzle so sublime that they cut the loop trail short and waited out the gray afternoon in the van.</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="D">Critics called the thriller&apos;s final scene sublime because it tied off every loose plot thread with tidy, almost workmanlike efficiency.</qti-simple-choice>
    </qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-A" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Sublime means so grand it inspires awe, so it&apos;s not the correct choice here because wide spaces and reliable elevators are conveniences — genuinely useful, but awe is not what a parking garage stirs.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-B" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Correct! Sublime means so grand or beautiful that it inspires awe, so it&apos;s the correct answer because the aurora is vast, otherworldly, and literally leaves its audience speechless.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-C" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Sublime describes greatness that holds you in awe, so it&apos;s not the correct choice here because the hikers abandon the trail to escape the drizzle — no one cuts short an experience that overwhelms them with wonder.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-D" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Sublime means awe-inspiring in its greatness, so it&apos;s not the correct choice here because tidy, workmanlike efficiency is craftsmanship praise — competence satisfies, but the sublime overwhelms.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing>
